.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH cache 1  "cache " 
.SH NAME
cache \- Inspect and manage the cloud run cache
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcache\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect and manage the cloud run cache
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
cache\-list(1)
List cached cloud snippets with sizes
.TP
cache\-clear(1)
Remove every cached snippet
.TP
cache\-path(1)
Print the cache directory path
.TP
cache\-prune(1)
Evict least\-recently\-used entries until the cache fits the given size (e.g. 50MB, 500KB, 2GB)
.TP
cache\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg cache list
  fg cache clear
